eakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":1069304122,"text":"やあ、「風の行方」に参加しないか？","nextNodeIds":[706700102,706700107]},{"nodeId":706700102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":934173258,"text":"まだ人を集めてるんだ…","nextNodeIds":[706700103]},{"nodeId":706700103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":3015766626,"text":"君だったか！前回「風の行方」で見せてくれた姿…なかなか上手だったから、かなり印象に残ってるよ。","nextNodeIds":[706700104]},{"nodeId":706700104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":891045098,"text":"でも、君は結構簡単そうに遊んでいたけど、他の人はそうじゃなかったみたいで。ゲームが難しすぎるとか、レンジャーは逃げにくいとか、ハンターは見つけられないとか。","nextNodeIds":[706700105]},{"nodeId":706700105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":1971233850,"text":"その上、ハンターに捕まったレンジャーはゲーム終了までやることがなくて、ただ隣でじっと見ることしかできないから、本当につまらないって愚痴ってきた人までいたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706700106]},{"nodeId":706700106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":513804634,"text":"はあ、その人たちの言ってることが正しいかどうかもわからないからね。もう少し人を集めて遊んでもらって、その意見を聞きたいと思ったんだ…","nextNodeIds":[706700120]},{"nodeId":706700120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":1633652010,"text":"コホンッ。これ以上、長々と話していても仕方ない。まずは実際に遊んでみてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[706700121,706700122]},{"nodeId":706700121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3188123370,"text":"「風の行方」を遊ぶ。","nextNodeIds":[706700123]},{"nodeId":706700123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":3628131450,"text":"分かった。もし「風の行方」を遊びたくなったら、またここに来てくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":706700122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":181974906,"text":"離れる","nextNodeIds":[706700123]},{"nodeId":706700107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":840052362,"text":"「風の行方」って？","nextNodeIds":[706700108]},{"nodeId":706700108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":4154422506,"text":"いい質問だ。「風の行方」はモンドの歴史が詰まったゲームなんだ！","nextNodeIds":[706700109]},{"nodeId":706700109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":1945282274,"text":"かつて、このモンド城には「貴族」がいたことを君も知っているね？","nextNodeIds":[706700110]},{"nodeId":706700110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":107350506,"text":"彼らはモンド城で数々の悪行を成し、多くの人々を苦しめた…","nextNodeIds":[706700111]},{"nodeId":706700111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":2018596698,"text":"そんな貴族たちの悪事に抗うため、勇敢なモンド人が集まった。そして、秘密の反抗組織を作り上げたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706700112]},{"nodeId":706700112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":2066383698,"text":"その勇敢な者たちはモンドで活動を続け、貴族たちを手こずらせた。","nextNodeIds":[706700113]},{"nodeId":706700113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":3025018690,"text":"しかし、貴族たちも黙ってはいなかった。すぐさまそれを鎮圧するために、手下たちを訓練したんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706700114]},{"nodeId":706700114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":142312554,"text":"こうして、反抗組織と貴族たちの対決が、モンドの各地で繰り広げられた。","nextNodeIds":[706700115]},{"nodeId":706700115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":4173506802,"text":"「風の行方」は、そんな壮大な歴史に基づいて作られたゲームなんだ！昔はとても人気があったんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[706700116]},{"nodeId":706700116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1269165698,"text":"昔は？","nextNodeIds":[706700117]},{"nodeId":706700117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":2105490682,"text":"ああ、最近の若者はあまり「風の行方」に興味ないみたいでね…","nextNodeIds":[706700118]},{"nodeId":706700118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":2373848482,"text":"だが、このまま「風の行方」が廃れていくのを見ているだなんて耐えられない。そこで、元のルールに少し手を加えて、より分かりやすく、そして面白くしてみた。","nextNodeIds":[706700119]},{"nodeId":706700119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","textMapHash":1553862978,"text":"さらに、新しいマップもいくつか用意したんだ。これなら、もっと多くの人に興味を持ってもらえるはずだ…","nextNodeIds":[706700120]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7067001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30051","SELECT_NPC_NONE"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7067001],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30051,"speakerName":"ガイガックス","count":18},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":5}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[170670],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2299322366,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Mengde_70670/Q7067001","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":706700101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_MAIN"